Package: sqlglotR
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to SQLGlot SQL Parser and Transpiler
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Package", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Wraps the Python SQLGlot library via reticulate to provide SQL
    parsing, column-level lineage extraction, boolean expression decomposition,
    and SQL dialect translation for R packages.
